+             * clobber real GDI content). A uniform NON-black readback (e.g. a solid
+             * 0x1d1d1d/0x2c2c2c panel background) is genuine content -> must still blit,
+             * else the panel goes WHITE. (Round-26 over-skip: skipped ALL uniform frames.) */
+            uniform_black = (content_dd < 2) && ((ref & 0xffffff) <= 0x080808);
